#: data/maps/OldaleTown_House1/scripts.inc:8
msgctxt "OldaleTown_House1_Text_LeftPokemonGoesOutFirst"
msgid ""
"When a POKéMON battle starts, the one\n"
"at the left of the list goes out first.\p"
"So, when you get more POKéMON in your\n"
"party, try switching around the order\l"
"of your POKéMON.\p"
"It could give you an advantage.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦对战开始时，\n"
"排在队伍最前面的宝可梦会先出场。\p"
"所以等你的同行宝可梦变多以后，\n"
"可以试着调换一下\l"
"宝可梦的顺序。\p"
"说不定会对你更有利哦。$"
